        "pkcontributionId": 69214,
        "bookId": 36,
        "chapterId": 50,
        "headingId": 539,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Metanephric stromal tumour is a renal stromal neoplasm composed of moderately cellular spindle cells identical to the stromal component of metanephric adenofibroma.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2022-02-10T16:44:47"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
